  "solution": {
    "text": "As the mass is at the verge of slipping<br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4.5</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
